  _id: 14041212
  _key: DIALOGUE_SERAPHINE_NODE_Q2_ACCEPTED
  _displayName: 
  _description: 
  _speakerName: Seraphine
  _dialogueText: 'Thank you, traveller.

    Follow the eastern path until you reach
    the altar. Carry a Light Source, for its ancient lanterns must be awakened before
    Aurelian will appear.

    When the seal breaks, prepare yourself. My brother
    was once the strongest of our order, and corruption has made him more dangerous
    still.

    If the burden becomes too great, call for me. I will stand beside
    you.

    Whatever awaits us... this time, I shall not turn away.'
  _choices:
  - _choiceText: I'll see you at the Eastern Altar.
    _requirements: []
    _actions: []
    _nextNode: {fileID: 0}
